# Codebase Auditor (project)

When the user asks for a **codebase audit**, **architecture / reliability / maintainability review**, **improvement plan** across the app, or invokes **Codebase Auditor**:

1. Open and follow [`.cursor/skills/codebase-auditor/SKILL.md`](.cursor/skills/codebase-auditor/SKILL.md) for the full workflow and finding template.
2. **Audit first** — ranked findings before rewrites; no broad refactors unless they explicitly approve scope.
3. Pay extra attention to the **interview → save → results** flow and fragile async/state/API boundaries.

For ordinary feature or bugfix work **without** an audit/review request, follow normal task scope; do not default to a full codebase audit.
